# the Sub page: EDIT's fourth page (after Play 2), only where the engine has a second page of knobs (knit, rayon);
# knit's: osc 2's interval (TP_X1, +-24 semitones about 64) and level, the sub, the noise, and the screen reader says
# them; another engine, or another track, takes the page away
wait 300
spin ALGO 2
expect trk 3
knob 3 engine jacquard
tap EDIT
expect page Engine
turn SELECT 1
expect page Play
turn SELECT 1
expect page Play_2
expect par3.oct 2
turn SELECT 1
expect page Engine
# knit: osc 2 in unison and off, a fourth page
knob 3 engine knit
expect par3.engine 0
expect par3.x1 64
expect par3.x2 0
listen
turn SELECT 3
expect page Sub
wait 400
said Sub
shot sub_off.png
spin K1 7
expect par3.x1 71
wait 400
said osc 2 +7 st
spin K2 50
expect par3.x2 50
spin K3 40
expect par3.x3 40
spin K4 20
expect par3.x4 20
wait 40
shot sub_layers.png
spin K1 -40
expect par3.x1 40
spin K1 60
expect par3.x1 88
spin K1 -17
expect par3.x1 71
# the list: the Sub page's knobs among EDIT's
tap SEL
wait 40
shot sub_list.png
tap HOME
# a note with the layers on
key 7 down
wait 200
expect voices 1
key 7 up
wait 300
turn SELECT 1
expect page Engine
turn SELECT -1
expect page Sub
# another track (jacquard: no Sub page): back to the button's first page
spin ALGO 1
expect trk 4
expect page Engine
spin ALGO -1
expect trk 3
turn SELECT -1
expect page Sub
# another engine on the Sub page (jacquard): back to Engine, three pages
knob 3 engine jacquard
expect page Engine
turn SELECT 1
expect page Play
turn SELECT 1
expect page Play_2
turn SELECT 1
expect page Engine
